    "body": "Not much \r\n\r\n* WebKit [bwo](https://bugs.webkit.org/buglist.cgi?bug_status=UNCONFIRMED&bug_status=NEW&bug_status=ASSIGNED&bug_status=REOPENED&bug_status=RESOLVED&bug_status=VERIFIED&f0=OP&f1=OP&f10=CP&f2=product&f3=component&f4=alias&f5=short_desc&f7=content&f8=bug_file_loc&f9=CP&j1=OR&list_id=9910326&o2=substring&o3=substring&o4=substring&o5=substring&o6=substring&o7=matches&o8=substring&query_format=advanced&v2=window.browser&v3=window.browser&v4=window.browser&v5=window.browser&v6=window.browser&v7=%22window.browser%22&v8=window.browser). \r\n* Gecko [bmo](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/buglist.cgi?f11=CP&v1=Graveyard&v5=window.browser&o8=substring&query_format=advanced&v7=window.browser&f3=OP&f10=bug_file_loc&f2=OP&f6=alias&f9=cf_crash_signature&o7=substring&f4=product&v8=window.browser&o5=substring&j3=OR&list_id=16823300&o1=notequals&f7=short_desc&f12=CP&o4=substring&f5=component&f1=classification&o9=substring&v6=window.browser&v10=window.browser&o10=substring&bug_status=UNCONFIRMED&bug_status=NEW&bug_status=ASSIGNED&bug_status=REOPENED&bug_status=RESOLVED&bug_status=VERIFIED&bug_status=CLOSED&o6=substring&v9=window.browser&f8=status_whiteboard&v4=window.browser) ",
